{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_14_level_main_14-04_beg",
  "groupId": "main_14",
  "stageId": "main_14-04",
  "title": "Cave Search",
  "storyCode": "14-5",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "175416ce14a42660bf6d69a2183250352b755a7cc6dd660ae6b4d352e145c715",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Abandoned Mansion, Londinium Outskirts"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nervous Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "text": "Is she back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unhappy Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "text": "Not yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nervous Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "text": "Damn, it was hard enough dodging those devils. How did she survive and even find us—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nervous Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "text": "How the heck did she know that I did business with the devils?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unhappy Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "text": "Well, consider that business deal lost."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nervous Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "text": "What about you? How'd she get you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unhappy Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "text": "She held a crossbow to my head."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unhappy Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "text": "I knew her from before. She didn't used to be so—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Didn't used to be so what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1342_1",
      "text": "Go on."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unhappy Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "text": "Er, no, I didn't—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The soldier, who has served the dukes all his life, lies on the ground, a crossbow pointed at his forehead.\nThe voice of the one holding the crossbow is cold as ice."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1342_1",
      "text": "I'm waiting."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Terrified Soldier",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I just—s-sorry, Millscar!"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I-I shouldn't have—\nAaaahh!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The bolt pierces his ear."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Millscar",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1342_1",
      "text": "Some people punch holes in their pets' ears as a sign of ownership."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Millscar",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1342_1",
      "text": "A man is not a pet, of course... but sometimes they're not so different, are they?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Terrified Soldier",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Millscar",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1342_1",
      "text": "Now get back up and give me a status report."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Millscar",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1342_1",
      "text": "Have you done what I've asked of you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Terrified Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "text": "Y-Yes, ma'am!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Terrified Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "text": "W-well, the reception at the monitoring station was really bad, so even though we tried to gather as much information as possible—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Millscar",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1342_1",
      "text": "Skip to the conclusion."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Terrified Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "text": "Based on what little information the Trilby Asher left behind, and the occasional intercepted comms, we can confirm that a unit called 'the Exemplars' has been formed, and its leader is most likely the one you spoke of..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Terrified Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "text": "'Vina'."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Terrified Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "text": "They seem to be headed for the front at Silverrock Bluffs."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Millscar",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1342_1",
      "text": "Silverrock Bluffs. They're really staying in this war."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Millscar",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1342_1",
      "text": "Keep at it. Notify me of any new developments."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Terrified Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "text": "Y-Yes, ma'am!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Millscar",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1342_1",
      "text": "—Phew."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Millscar",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1342_1",
      "text": "Well, this is easier than expected."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Millscar",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1342_1",
      "text": "I thought it would be tougher."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Millscar",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1342_1",
      "text": "No scruples. No acts to put up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Millscar",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1342_1",
      "text": "I found <i>Victoria</i>."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A red light flashes a few times in the deep shadows."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Millscar",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1342_1",
      "text": "Isn't it your job to protect her?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Forty-three hours into the operation..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "text": "I knew you would come."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "text": "...Ulšulah."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "text": "That mad bomber W came once to set up this prison."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "text": "Ines came twice to show 'compassion'. Same old Ines, always a tad slow with her retort when she's focused on someone else's shadow."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "text": "Now, it's you. What have you come to say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "text": "Have you thought it over?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "text": "That's my line."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "text": "Your situation is perilous. Your only vehicle lies disabled."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "text": "As the pilot, I'm very likely to know something that you don't, and probably am waiting for the right time to strike."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "text": "Really, you should kill me, Hoederer."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "text": "I would rather you helped us with what you know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "text": "In your dreams."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "text": "I already turned you down once. You give me too little credit if you think I would change my mind just because I'm a prisoner."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "text": "Three times."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "text": "You saved our lives three times back in Kazdel. My life once, Ines's life twice."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "text": "You wrote all that in your diary?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "text": "Name your price. I'll do my best to pay it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "text": "You'll go bankrupt if you quit the mercenary life to open a business."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "text": "I just want as many Sarkaz to make it back to Kazdel alive as possible."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "text": "Such grand ambitions."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "text": "But enough chitchat. Let the old rules of Scar Market lie buried beneath Kazdel. Our debt is settled."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "text": "One last warning, Hoederer. Kill me now, or you'll regret it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "text": "Did it ever occur to you that we both want the same thing—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "text": "Enough of your righteous crap."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "text": "Don't try to buy my life with your flowery words, old friend. They're not much better than money."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "text": "A mercenary takes no sides. But you and I aren't really mercenaries anymore."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "Wanna bet, Ines?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "Hoederer's gonna try talking Ulšulah into helping for old time's sake at Scar Market. Ulšulah's gonna tell him to just get it over with, and Hoederer's gonna come back with a long face."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "text": "What's the wager?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "That's it? I figured you'd be jealous with the two of them all alone in a room together."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "text": "...W."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "Stop trying to read my shadow, Ines. I'm not in the mood."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "The bunny and the Victorian have been gone for a while... wonder how things are going out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "Bonesy is still playing dead, and Theresis's Catastrophe refuses to go away. Who knows, maybe Manfred's gonna just pop out of nowhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "I could have blown Theresis up right then and there!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "text": "I know you're restless because of Theresa, but hold that fuse for a moment. We have a lot of prep work to do."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "*Sarkaz swearing*! Who said I was—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W Squad Member",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1336_1",
      "text": "We've got a problem, W..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "Out with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W Squad Member",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1336_1",
      "text": "It's time for a shift change, but not all our scouts came back."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W Squad Member",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1336_1",
      "text": "Crane's team went off to the north side of the canyon, and we can't reach them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "Don't tell me they ran into a decent enemy caster."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "text": "When was your last communication?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W Squad Member",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1336_1",
      "text": "Almost three hours ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "text": "If our enemy could make an entire merc squad disappear without a sound, they would've been on top of us by now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "text": "The most important thing to do at the moment is keep the Lifebone safe."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "We're just gonna sit here when we know something's going on outside?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ascalon",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "text": "I agree with Ines."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ascalon",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "text": "We know nothing about this place. The safest course of action is to concentrate our forces."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "Cut the crap. My men are missing. I want to know why."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "If they got lost, I'll bring them back. If somebody did them in, I'll return the favor."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "text": "Calm down! This could be a trap to split us up—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "I don't like playing defense. Even if it's a trap, I'll just blast them out of hiding."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "Give me half a day. If I don't come back, that means I'm up against a real nasty piece of work. Don't come after me, get your defenses ready."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "If you get a call from Amiya, don't wait for me, just activate the Lifebone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "I'll take my own squad. No need to bother anyone else."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "You lot. Grab your weapons and follow me."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "Is this where they went?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W Squad Member",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1336_1",
      "text": "Should be. This cave was all we saw when we went north into the canyon. We don't know what's inside."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W Squad Member",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1336_1",
      "text": "Hidden passage? The court's secret cache?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "If this was a secret base of the Royal Court, we'd have had a couple hundred Vampires and Nachzehrers on our asses the moment we fell in here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "Based on Closure's intel, we're in the hills to the west of Londinium, a good distance from the main battlefield where those old farts are."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Somehow, though, I smell... (sniffs)\nThe old, moldy stench from someone who's been here for ages."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "I don't like old stuff, but I'm sure Hoederer would love it."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "Let me guess. What enemy did our lucky winners run into?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W Squad Member",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1336_1",
      "text": "W, when did you use your bombs?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "You delusional? Did you see me use them on our way here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W Squad Member",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1336_1",
      "text": "Then what are these burn marks on the wall?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "Huh...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "Strange. No sign of Arts, but how do you leave marks like these on stone, then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W Squad Member",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1336_1",
      "text": "Did you hear that?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "What is it this time?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W Squad Member",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1336_1",
      "text": "It's the sound of someone striking iron... there's somebody here!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "You're just hearing things."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "Stop spooking yourself. Nobody's here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W Squad Member",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1336_1",
      "text": "Do we keep going, W? I have a bad feeling about this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "Of course. Why do you think we're here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "That's top-grade gear you all are using. I'm not rich enough to just let them rot in some cave."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W Squad Member",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1336_1",
      "text": "Have you heard the Sarkaz legend... before Qui'lon was even born, the Sarkaz and a red dragon—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "Shut up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "One historian in Hoederer is enough. Say anymore, and I'll throw you to the front—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W Squad Member",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1336_1",
      "text": "What is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_412_1",
      "text": "Blood... but not Sarkaz."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It's fresh—\nGet ready to fight!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1335_1",
      "text": "*Roar*—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
